      "id": "d4",
      "title": "Make every skip observable",
      "source": "author",
      "chose": "Warning log plus a new record_skipped_unrecognized_category metric.",
      "rejected": "Skip silently",
      "why": "A silent skip and a lost message look identical from outside — and this path exists because an upstream contract is leaking. The metric turns 'we're dropping records' into a rate the team can alarm on and hand back upstream. The skip is a symptom worth watching, not a fix to forget.",
      "quote": "Skips are observable: a warning log + a new record_skipped_unrecognized_category metric.",
